comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:17:26.281Z",codex-root,Official June 2026 docs distinguish REST and WebSocket service-action response shapes; the live current server confirms the REST object shape for return_response.
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:17:26.281Z",codex-root,"Never record entity IDs, raw service responses, access tokens, URLs beyond public documentation examples, or private topology in PM or GitHub evidence."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-27T21:17:26.281Z",codex-root,Presence-based Commander boolean environment parsing can override a downstream parser; boolean ENV contracts must be tested at the full CLI boundary.
close_reason: "Typed service-action contracts, read-only safety, programmatic output, documentation, clean-runner PM SDK provisioning, and release automation gates are implemented and fully verified in PR #77."
body: "Research the latest official Home Assistant action APIs and the configured current server; correct transport-specific response typing; expose explicit target and response controls; preserve legacy command compatibility; validate setup, formats, schema, help, packaging, release automation, and private live execution without persisting identifiers."
